<title>USA: Interstate Hotels to buy Chicago hotel.</title>
<headline>Interstate Hotels to buy Chicago hotel.</headline>
<dateline>PITTSBURGH, Pa. 1997-03-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>Interstate Hotels Co said Wednesday it had reached a definitive agreement to buy the Chicago Embassy Suites Hotel in Chicago, Ill., for $67 million.  </p>
<p>Interstate, which owns, manages and leases more than 200 hotels, said it expected to close the deal in March.</p>
<p>Chicago Embassy Suites is a 358-room upscale hotel located in the center of the city.</p>
